      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Postoperative pain following day surgery is a common problem. The prescription of appropriate analgesia with clear instructions for the patient is crucial. This article examines the effect of changing prescribing practice, backed up by a patient information leaflet, on the effectiveness of take-home analgesia after day case surgery."},
